  report-data checks precede REPORT_ID extraction and verified receipt creation.
  Captured-fixture promotion and inconsistent trust/binding metadata fail.
  Immutable verified receipt binds request context, REPORT_ID, report digest
  and locally selected verifier trust. Operation-local slot accepts first
  delivery, reports exact retry without replacement, and rejects changed
  context/identity/report/trust without mutating accepted state.
  Inline and matching reference retry are equivalent. All report bytes,
  including signature bytes, participate in the base-report cache digest.
