  Explicit request, role/direction and canonical session-digest equality,
  typed rejection/outcome, optional observed raw status and canonical zero
  padding/absence/non-success digest. Missing status is never success.
  Destination tag -> source tag -> separate persisted-state verification
    -> matching typed success result -> private non-cloneable receipt.
